<uscom:P com:pNumber="1" com:id="p-001" uscom:alignmentCategory="center"><?PageStart number='1'?><uscom:BoundaryDataReference com:idref="bd-001" /><com:B><com:I>Notice of Pre-AIA or AIA Status</com:I></com:B></uscom:P>
<uscom:FormParagraph com:id="fp-001"><uscom:FormParagraphNumber com:id="fpn-001">07-03-aia</uscom:FormParagraphNumber><uscom:P com:pNumber="4" com:id="p-004">This is a synthetic test document. The present application is treated as examined under the first inventor to file provisions of the AIA.</uscom:P>
</uscom:FormParagraph><uscom:P com:pNumber="5" com:id="p-005">                                           <com:B>Response to RCE</com:B></uscom:P>
<uscom:FormParagraph com:id="fp-002"><uscom:FormParagraphNumber com:id="fpn-003">07-42-05</uscom:FormParagraphNumber><uscom:P com:pNumber="6" com:id="p-006">A synthetic request for continued examination was filed in this invented application. The applicant's submission filed on <uscom:DataField com:id="df001" uscom:dataFieldNumber="1"><uscom:GeneralText>01/02/2026</uscom:GeneralText></uscom:DataField> has been entered. </uscom:P>
</uscom:FormParagraph><uscom:P com:pNumber="10" com:id="p-010" uscom:alignmentCategory="center"><com:B><com:I>Claim Rejections - 35 USC § 103</com:I></com:B></uscom:P>
<uscom:FormParagraph com:id="fp-004"><uscom:FormParagraphNumber com:id="fpn-005">07-20-aia</uscom:FormParagraphNumber><uscom:P com:pNumber="11" com:id="p-011">The following is a synthetic paraphrase of the statutory basis for obviousness rejections in this invented Office action.</uscom:P>
</uscom:FormParagraph><uscom:P com:pNumber="13" com:id="p-013">Claims 1-3 are rejected under 35 U.S.C. 103 as being unpatentable over Example Reference A (US 0000001) in view of Example Reference B (US 0000002).</uscom:P>
<uscom:P com:pNumber="14" com:id="p-014">Regarding claim 1, Example Reference A discloses a widget with a sensor. Example Reference B teaches a controller. It would have been obvious to combine them (invented rationale for testing only).</uscom:P>
<uscom:P com:pNumber="15" com:id="p-015" uscom:alignmentCategory="center"><com:B><com:I>Conclusion</com:I></com:B></uscom:P>
<uscom:P com:pNumber="16" com:id="p-016">Any inquiry concerning this communication should be directed to the Examiner of this invented application.</uscom:P>
